# .clauderules — Claude Code & Claude AI Rules
# Enterprise SaaS Starter Kit — Laravel 12 + Filament 4

## Identity
You are a senior PHP/Laravel architect.
Your job is to build a production-grade SaaS platform, not to demo concepts.
Write code that is deployed, tested, and maintainable.

## Non-negotiable rules

1. Read `CLAUDE.md` in full before any task
2. One task = one layer or one module feature. Never combine multiple layers in one response.
3. Always generate the corresponding test file alongside any Action or Service
4. Always use DTOs. No exceptions.
5. All classes are `final` unless designed for inheritance
6. All files start with `declare(strict_types=1);`

---

## Task execution pattern

When given a task:
1. State which layer this belongs to (Action / Service / Repository / etc.)
2. List the files you will create or modify
3. Write the code
4. Write the PestPHP test
5. Note any Event that should be fired

---

## AI Module — Three Providers

The AI module supports three providers via a unified interface.
Never import a provider SDK directly outside of its implementation class.

### Interface
```php
// app/Infrastructure/AI/Contracts/AIProviderInterface.php
interface AIProviderInterface
{
    public function complete(AIRequestDTO $request): AIResponseDTO;
    public function stream(AIRequestDTO $request): \Generator;
    public function embed(string $text): array;
}
```

### Claude (Anthropic)
```php
// Modules/AI/src/Providers/ClaudeProvider.php
use Anthropic\Laravel\Facades\Anthropic;

final class ClaudeProvider implements AIProviderInterface
{
    public function complete(AIRequestDTO $request): AIResponseDTO
    {
        $response = Anthropic::messages()->create([
            'model'      => $request->model ?? 'claude-opus-4-5',
            'max_tokens' => $request->maxTokens ?? 1024,
            'messages'   => [['role' => 'user', 'content' => $request->prompt]],
        ]);

        return new AIResponseDTO(
            content: $response->content[0]->text,
            model:   $response->model,
            tokens:  $response->usage->inputTokens + $response->usage->outputTokens,
        );
    }

    public function stream(AIRequestDTO $request): \Generator
    {
        $stream = Anthropic::messages()->createStreamed([
            'model'      => $request->model ?? 'claude-opus-4-5',
            'max_tokens' => $request->maxTokens ?? 1024,
            'messages'   => [['role' => 'user', 'content' => $request->prompt]],
        ]);

        foreach ($stream as $event) {
            if ($event->type === 'content_block_delta') {
                yield $event->delta->text;
            }
        }
    }

    public function embed(string $text): array
    {
        // Claude doesn't have embeddings — fall back to OpenAI
        throw new \RuntimeException('Use OpenAI or Gemini for embeddings');
    }
}
```

### OpenAI
```php
// Modules/AI/src/Providers/OpenAIProvider.php
use OpenAI\Laravel\Facades\OpenAI;

final class OpenAIProvider implements AIProviderInterface
{
    public function complete(AIRequestDTO $request): AIResponseDTO
    {
        $response = OpenAI::chat()->create([
            'model'    => $request->model ?? 'gpt-4o',
            'messages' => [['role' => 'user', 'content' => $request->prompt]],
        ]);

        return new AIResponseDTO(
            content: $response->choices[0]->message->content,
            model:   $response->model,
            tokens:  $response->usage->totalTokens,
        );
    }

    public function stream(AIRequestDTO $request): \Generator
    {
        $stream = OpenAI::chat()->createStreamed([
            'model'    => $request->model ?? 'gpt-4o',
            'messages' => [['role' => 'user', 'content' => $request->prompt]],
        ]);

        foreach ($stream as $response) {
            yield $response->choices[0]->delta->content ?? '';
        }
    }

    public function embed(string $text): array
    {
        $response = OpenAI::embeddings()->create([
            'model' => 'text-embedding-3-small',
            'input' => $text,
        ]);

        return $response->embeddings[0]->embedding;
    }
}
```

### Gemini
```php
// Modules/AI/src/Providers/GeminiProvider.php
use Gemini\Laravel\Facades\Gemini;

final class GeminiProvider implements AIProviderInterface
{
    public function complete(AIRequestDTO $request): AIResponseDTO
    {
        $response = Gemini::geminiPro()->generateContent($request->prompt);

        return new AIResponseDTO(
            content: $response->text(),
            model:   $request->model ?? 'gemini-pro',
            tokens:  0,
        );
    }

    public function stream(AIRequestDTO $request): \Generator
    {
        $stream = Gemini::geminiPro()->streamGenerateContent($request->prompt);

        foreach ($stream as $response) {
            yield $response->text();
        }
    }

    public function embed(string $text): array
    {
        $response = Gemini::embeddingModel()->embedContent($text);
        return $response->embedding->values;
    }
}
```

### Factory
```php
// app/Infrastructure/AI/AIProviderFactory.php
final class AIProviderFactory
{
    public static function make(?string $provider = null): AIProviderInterface
    {
        return match($provider ?? config('ai.default')) {
            'claude'    => app(ClaudeProvider::class),
            'openai'    => app(OpenAIProvider::class),
            'gemini'    => app(GeminiProvider::class),
            default     => throw new \InvalidArgumentException("Unknown AI provider: {$provider}"),
        };
    }
}
```

### Usage in any Action
```php
final class GenerateSummaryAction
{
    public function __construct(
        private readonly AIProviderInterface $ai,
    ) {}

    public function handle(string $text): string
    {
        $response = $this->ai->complete(new AIRequestDTO(
            prompt: "Summarize this: {$text}",
        ));

        return $response->content;
    }
}
```

