## Service Provider binding

```php
// Modules/AI/src/Providers/AIServiceProvider.php
public function register(): void
{
    $this->app->bind(AIProviderInterface::class, function () {
        return AIProviderFactory::make();
    });
}
```

---

## Response format for code tasks

Always respond in this order:
1. Files to create (list)
2. Each file with full code
3. PestPHP test
4. Any migration needed
5. Any config or env variable needed
